    "text": "khqa.com\nwebsite\nHannibal\nGas leak prompts evacuation at Hannibal’s Veterans Elementary\nBy KHQA News Desk,\n7 hours agoHANNIBAL, Mo — Students at Veterans Elementary School were evacuated on Wednesday afternoon after a contractor struck a gas line during playground construction, resulting in a leak on campus. The incident occurred around 12:40 p.m., according to the Hannibal Public School District. Students and staff were evacuated immediately and...\n3",
